    {
      "id": "typical_improver_traverses",
      "statement": "A typical improver fully traverses the machine (full -> reduced -> probe -> removed) for at least 2 of 3 elements within one training block of 15 laps.",
      "operationalisation": "The target is about the TYPICAL learner, so it is read as the median stream: at least half of typical_improver streams must traverse 2 of 3 elements.",
